    <tr><td>10:30</td><td>ten thirty</td></tr>
    <tr><td>21st</td><td>twenty-first</td></tr>
    <tr><td>in 1984</td><td>in nineteen eighty-four</td></tr>
    <tr><td>25%</td><td>twenty-five percent</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2>Limits</h2>
<ul>
  <li>English only. Text in other languages is read with English sounds.</li>
  <li>Rare names can sound wrong. Write them as they sound to fix that.</li>
  <li>On a laptop processor, a minute of speech takes about 20 to 60 seconds to make.</li>
</ul>
